            {
              "content": "=You are a real estate data extraction expert. \n\nExtract ALL metadata from the following German real estate listing text that is relevant for cashflow and investment analysis.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with this exact structure (use null for missing fields):\n\n{\n  \"listing\": {\n    \"id\": \"\",\n    \"url\": \"\",\n    \"title\": \"\",\n    \"property_type\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"location\": {\n    \"street\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"zip_code\": \"\",\n    \"district\": \"\",\n    \"state\": \"\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\"\n  },\n  \"property\": {\n    \"living_area_m2\": null,\n    \"total_area_m2\": null,\n    \"land_area_m2\": null,\n    \"rooms\": null,\n    \"bedrooms\": null,\n    \"bathrooms\": null,\n    \"floor\": null,\n    \"total_floors\": null,\n    \"year_built\": null,\n    \"last_renovation_year\": null,\n    \"condition\": \"\",\n    \"has_balcony\": null,\n    \"has_terrace\": null,\n    \"has_garden\": null,\n    \"has_cellar\": null,\n    \"has_elevator\": null,\n    \"parking_spots\": null,\n    \"parking_type\": \"\",\n    \"monument_protected\": null\n  },\n  \"financials\": {\n    \"purchase_price_eur\": null,\n    \"price_per_m2_eur\": null,\n    \"monthly_cold_rent_eur\": null,\n    \"monthly_warm_rent_eur\": null,\n    \"monthly_service_charges_eur\": null,\n    \"monthly_hoa_fee_eur\": null,\n    \"annual_gross_rent_eur\": null,\n    \"gross_yield_percent\": null,\n    \"ground_rent_eur\": null,\n    \"is_currently_rented\": null,\n    \"rent_indexed\": null\n  },\n  \"energy\": {\n    \"energy_class\": \"\",\n    \"energy_consumption_kwh_m2\": null,\n    \"heating_type\": \"\",\n    \"energy_certificate_type\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"transaction\": {\n    \"commission_buyer_percent\": null,\n    \"commission_buyer_eur\": null,\n    \"available_from\": \"\",\n    \"listing_date\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nListing text:\n{{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
